      "content": "The refine and sort toolbar under the header. Each filter only offers what the residences for sale actually have: bedroom and bathroom steps stop at the largest count listed, a filter with one answer stays hidden, and Features lists only the features some residence has. Filtering happens on The residences grid below. Not shown on the Sold page."
